<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
<title>How did you like Clover?</title>
<style>
  body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #EAFBFF; }
  a { color: #FF5757; }
  .stars { direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: bidi-override; }
  .stars a { color: #FFB800; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: transform .15s ease, color .15s ease; }
  .stars:hover a { color: #F6DFA6 !important; }
  .stars a:hover, .stars a:hover ~ a { color: #FFB800 !important; }
  .stars a:hover { transform: scale(1.18); }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .px { padding-left: 22px !important; padding-right: 22px !important; }
    .h1 { font-size: 29px !important; line-height: 35px !important; }
    .btn a { display: block !important; }
    .stars a { font-size: 44px !important; padding: 0 2px !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#EAFBFF;">
  <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;color:#EAFBFF;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;">
    Would you share what your little reader thought of Clover? It only takes a minute and means the world to me.
  </div>

  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#EAFBFF;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="text-align:center;padding:20px 8px 28px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;">

          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="text-align:center;padding:6px 0 18px;">
              <a href="{{ shop.url }}" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
                <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0828/6594/6879/files/Untitled_design-63.png?v=1783471619&amp;width=360" width="180" alt="Clover Stories" style="display:block;width:180px;height:auto;border:0;margin:0 auto;">
              </a>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="text-align:left;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(43,29,20,.08);">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">

                <tr>
                  <td bgcolor="#D6F4FF" style="background-color:#D6F4FF;border-radius:28px 28px 0 0;text-align:center;">
                    <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0828/6594/6879/files/email-sky-top.png?v=1790892516&amp;width=1200" width="600" alt="" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;">
                    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                      <tr>
                        <td class="px" align="center" style="text-align:center;padding:0 40px;font-family:'Trebuchet MS',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
                          <p style="margin:0 0 14px;"><span style="display:inline-block;background:#FFFFFF;color:#518339;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:99px;">&#128218; A little favor from Melanie</span></p>
                          <h1 class="h1" style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Trebuchet MS',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:34px;line-height:40px;color:#2B1D14;font-weight:bold;">
                            {% if customer.first_name != blank %}{{ customer.first_name }}, how{% else %}How{% endif %} did your little reader like <span style="color:#FF5757;">Clover?</span>
                          </h1>
                          <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:17px;line-height:27px;color:#40525A;">I hope Clover has become a storytime favorite at your house!</p>
                          <a href="https://judge.me/product_reviews/446c38bc-b6e4-4c62-97ed-9ed85df4cb5d/new?id=9569407140095&amp;source=shareable-link" target="_blank" style="text-decoration:none;">
                            <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0828/6594/6879/files/clovercoverupdated_merged_2.jpg?v=1783625495&amp;width=500" width="200" alt="Clover, the Brave Chicken book cover" style="display:block;width:200px;max-width:60%;height:auto;border:0;margin:16px auto 0;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(43,29,20,.18);">
                          </a>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                    <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0828/6594/6879/files/email-grass.png?v=1790892516&amp;width=1200" width="600" alt="" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;border:0;">
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td class="px" align="center" style="text-align:center;padding:28px 36px 6px;font-family:'Trebuchet MS',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:21px;line-height:27px;font-weight:bold;color:#2B1D14;">Tap a star to rate the book</p>
                    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#8A817C;">It only takes a minute</p>
                    <div class="stars" style="direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:bidi-override;text-align:center;font-size:0;line-height:1;margin:0 auto;">
                      <a href="https://judge.me/product_reviews/446c38bc-b6e4-4c62-97ed-9ed85df4cb5d/new?id=9569407140095&amp;source=shareable-link" target="_blank" title="5 stars, loved it!" style="display:inline-block;color:#FFB800;font-size:52px;line-height:60px;padding:0 4px;text-decoration:none;">&#9733;</a><a href="https://judge.me/product_reviews/446c38bc-b6e4-4c62-97ed-9ed85df4cb5d/new?id=9569407140095&amp;source=shareable-link" target="_blank" title="4 stars" style="display:inline-block;color:#FFB800;font-size:52px;line-height:60px;padding:0 4px;text-decoration:none;">&#9733;</a><a href="https://judge.me/product_reviews/446c38bc-b6e4-4c62-97ed-9ed85df4cb5d/new?id=9569407140095&amp;source=shareable-link" target="_blank" title="3 stars" style="display:inline-block;color:#FFB800;font-size:52px;line-height:60px;padding:0 4px;text-decoration:none;">&#9733;</a><a href="https://judge.me/product_reviews/446c38bc-b6e4-4c62-97ed-9ed85df4cb5d/new?id=9569407140095&amp;source=shareable-link" target="_blank" title="2 stars" style="display:inline-block;color:#FFB800;font-size:52px;line-height:60px;padding:0 4px;text-decoration:none;">&#9733;</a><a href="https://judge.me/product_reviews/446c38bc-b6e4-4c62-97ed-9ed85df4cb5d/new?id=9569407140095&amp;source=shareable-link" target="_blank" title="1 star" style="display:inline-block;color:#FFB800;font-size:52px;line-height:60px;padding:0 4px;text-decoration:none;">&#9733;</a>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td align="center" class="btn px" style="text-align:center;padding:16px 36px 6px;">
                    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 auto;">
                      <tr>
                        <td align="center" bgcolor="#FF5757" style="text-align:center;background-color:#FF5757;border-radius:99px;">
                          <a href="https://judge.me/product_reviews/446c38bc-b6e4-4c62-97ed-9ed85df4cb5d/new?id=9569407140095&amp;source=shareable-link" target="_blank" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#FF5757;border-bottom:4px solid #C62A1E;padding:17px 38px;font-family:'Trebuchet MS',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:99px;">Write a quick review</a>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td class="px" style="padding:28px 36px 6px;font-family:'Trebuchet MS',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
                    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background:#FFF3ED;border-radius:22px;">
                      <tr>
                        <td style="padding:22px 24px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#5E5652;text-align:left;">
                          <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Trebuchet MS',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#2B1D14;">Why your review matters so much &#10084;&#65039;</p>
                          <p style="margin:0 0 10px;">I'm an independent author, so every single review helps another family find Clover and her message that the bravest thing you can be is yourself.</p>
                          <p style="margin:0;">Not sure what to write? Tell us your little one's favorite page, a funny thing they said, or how Clover made them feel. A sentence or two is perfect!</p>
                        </td>
                      </tr>
                    </table>
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td class="px" align="center" style="text-align:center;padding:26px 44px 36px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
                    <p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px;line-height:23px;color:#5E5652;">Thank you for reading with Clover, and for helping her find new friends.</p>
                    <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0828/6594/6879/files/email-signature.png?v=1790891320&amp;width=440" width="200" alt="Melanie" style="display:block;width:200px;max-width:70%;height:auto;border:0;margin:10px auto 2px;">
                    <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#8A817C;">Author of <em>Clover, the Brave Chicken</em></p>
                  </td>
                </tr>

              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="text-align:center;padding:22px 20px 0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:19px;color:#6F8791;">
              <p style="margin:0 0 6px;text-align:center;"><a href="{{ shop.url }}" target="_blank" style="color:#518339;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;">cloverstories.com</a></p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 6px;text-align:center;">You're getting this because you bought <em>Clover, the Brave Chicken</em> at {{ shop.name }}.</p>
              <p style="margin:0;text-align:center;">{{ unsubscribe_link }}</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  {{ open_tracking_block }}
</body>
</html>
